	(gr_text "For Darryl. A small bit of my know-how in exchange for all you have shared with me over the years.\nIt has been a heck of a ride. Some of the dumbest things I've done, you were right beside me.\nIt is an honor to call you Darryl/Dad.\nThank You,\nScott"
		(at 168.5 100 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "98d855ae-40a8-433f-b6ef-3492a7b92e45")
		(effects
			(font
